{
  "schema_version": "h004-evidence-index/v1",
  "records": {
    "R001": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:4",
        "paragraph:5"
      ],
      "text": "R001 物理计算核心 [必须]\n要求：提供至少32个物理核心，不能用逻辑线程数替代物理核心数。",
      "text_sha256": "8cb184315561dc8c0e0bd45585a8b023f2de2a7ddc0e1f00898ca3da56a9e33c"
    },
    "R002": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:6",
        "paragraph:7"
      ],
      "text": "R002 内存与校验 [必须]\n要求：提供至少128GB内存并支持ECC校验，两个条件均需材料支持。",
      "text_sha256": "ac9968fa2620e7dd160462c24e6b9ccf4ea54f43819253ead8535d70d869b17c"
    },
    "R003": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:8",
        "paragraph:9"
      ],
      "text": "R003 可用存储容量 [必须]\n要求：可用容量不少于8TB，以冗余后的可用容量为准，不按原始总容量判断。",
      "text_sha256": "254bbe983ba6de8b2ad6f7576b60c2d82312161f2394a68d1ae90999fd26b112"
    },
    "R004": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:10",
        "paragraph:11"
      ],
      "text": "R004 独立网络接口 [必须]\n要求：提供2个独立10GbE业务口，1Gb管理口不能替代业务口。",
      "text_sha256": "42a6d392ab685b4d2c1281ab34f38996e6a8b2f9f19d239c61da084484bdf14f"
    },
    "R005": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:12",
        "paragraph:13"
      ],
      "text": "R005 电源维护能力 [建议]\n要求：建议同时具有冗余电源和不停机热插拔能力，两个能力分别说明。",
      "text_sha256": "0f994b0745db85afdc7e1431e02d1b10d5cf66602984c53fc1d50c05e40c254a"
    },
    "R006": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:14",
        "paragraph:15"
      ],
      "text": "R006 工作温度范围 [建议]\n要求：建议在0至40摄氏度范围稳定工作，不能拿存放温度作为工作温度。",
      "text_sha256": "a18693867b9a32b54a872ef3353ab868db7b0d706c022dc8604a3b2b6ec7fb8c"
    },
    "R007": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:16",
        "paragraph:17"
      ],
      "text": "R007 文件名与字节保真 [必须]\n要求：中文及其它UTF-8文件名可导入，且文件内容保持原始字节，不经转码改写。",
      "text_sha256": "bb5fca4c3c53a90af080cadd6270c0ffce5038582daa8593e221326ca58f5729"
    },
    "R008": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:19",
        "paragraph:20"
      ],
      "text": "R008 已确认数据持久化 [必须]\n要求：单节点重启后，已向用户确认的数据仍可恢复，不能只证明进程能够再次启动。",
      "text_sha256": "6e9dcd62f2ab8d0f86caefeead83708cd6e3f2ae2995379d59ebf7b0ef2320ae"
    },
    "R009": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:21",
        "paragraph:22"
      ],
      "text": "R009 离线安装材料 [建议]\n要求：建议提供离线安装包、版本清单和校验信息，不依赖现场联网下载。",
      "text_sha256": "fe5e1811ae3b0f33e35d49d5fcc6c11793cf8acfd0f0354f0cf71653750ddb93"
    },
    "R010": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:23",
        "paragraph:24"
      ],
      "text": "R010 两种架构兼容 [必须]\n要求：同时支持指定Debian12的x86-64与arm64环境，不能仅说明操作系统名称相同。",
      "text_sha256": "48b7d1bdc86e91ce8ae037f0392c5df60865429feb2320d7c5b7e5c450845134"
    },
    "R011": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:25",
        "paragraph:26"
      ],
      "text": "R011 项目隔离 [必须]\n要求：不同项目的数据不可互读，需有项目级隔离依据，不能仅用服务器数量解释。",
      "text_sha256": "9a64fa9a89723ecc42dd67634970658f4e0db0a16cf26f6a20b41b71f2cf99e7"
    },
    "R012": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:27",
        "paragraph:28"
      ],
      "text": "R012 两类本地检索 [建议]\n要求：建议支持记录ID精确查找和字段内容检索，二者分别保留结果。",
      "text_sha256": "47b7ed2ef7706bbcb6fe9e9881532dc50a05512252fa0f2c7e0073a31415e5e1"
    },
    "R013": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:29",
        "paragraph:30"
      ],
      "text": "R013 账户停用后授权 [建议]\n要求：建议停用账户后拒绝新会话并吊销现有令牌，不以隐藏账户按钮替代。",
      "text_sha256": "865eda9b6d2ac3a7b2e3b70ffa0ee2bdae4df5b6273a4265223d470eedd14aa3"
    },
    "R014": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:31",
        "paragraph:32"
      ],
      "text": "R014 角色及记录范围 [必须]\n要求：授权须同时支持岗位角色与记录级数据范围，只有角色菜单不能认定全部覆盖。",
      "text_sha256": "8afdc3865cc9c8a08305bda73e3a925e39be0d0c5c388bb354d19d252e29c6d9"
    },
    "R015": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:34",
        "paragraph:35"
      ],
      "text": "R015 导出权限一致 [必须]\n要求：导出应遵循现有访问权限，不能因转成文件而绕过权限校验。",
      "text_sha256": "4c939151eee5a8b0a538f8a783ce0059ea0eab6a6d1ab04f03610219523bd280"
    },
    "R016": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:36",
        "paragraph:37"
      ],
      "text": "R016 版本追踪与恢复 [建议]\n要求：建议能查历史版本并恢复指定版本，只有最后修改时间不够。",
      "text_sha256": "026f586e5617ea36a00bbeb13f41de21323d00e4ae27d8fe197c96553d867c08"
    },
    "R017": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:38",
        "paragraph:39"
      ],
      "text": "R017 失败子项重试 [必须]\n要求：批量处理应有逐项结果，并允许只重试失败子项，不能用整批重试代替。",
      "text_sha256": "862a1218d91002cebdd2103479dcad72bf779172d983269d82a4773d3e383319"
    },
    "R018": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:40",
        "paragraph:41"
      ],
      "text": "R018 传输通道保护 [必须]\n要求：传输通道使用TLS1.2或更高版本，并有当前配置依据；此项不覆盖静态备份加密。",
      "text_sha256": "66da260c6beb726be190222ca7e02e72094ea40df0d414eee4cf10cd6e403ac6"
    },
    "R019": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:42",
        "paragraph:43"
      ],
      "text": "R019 静态备份加密 [必须]\n要求：本地备份文件应具有产品内置的静态加密，外部尚未部署的磁盘加密方案不能算现有能力。",
      "text_sha256": "39b8d4aae707efa3202bb9e9ee8b0d306b21c27ae98c4d414cce4d95ec4d353b"
    },
    "R020": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:44",
        "paragraph:45"
      ],
      "text": "R020 审计字段与留存 [必须]\n要求：审计记录应含操作者、时间、对象，并可留存至少180天，各条件分别有依据。",
      "text_sha256": "b21510ffbf8ac4924c6885fef3bcd4371c339cfc421df230a397c97fe9fdff86"
    },
    "R021": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:46",
        "paragraph:47"
      ],
      "text": "R021 CSV基础格式 [建议]\n要求：建议CSV导出支持UTF-8及引号、换行转义；基础格式不能代替稳定ID与续传能力。",
      "text_sha256": "be4ee400bd679f29bf0ccadde8c11dc8460a88d0cea6ba4736cebdcfcc47c351"
    },
    "R022": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:49",
        "paragraph:50"
      ],
      "text": "R022 稳定ID及续页导出 [必须]\n要求：导出需保留稳定记录ID，并支持按已确认页继续导出；仅有CSV格式或大内存不够。",
      "text_sha256": "2d7d8feea70a780c762b36a03e6d407e0ed3e9e195be837475873f9de311b969"
    },
    "R023": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:51",
        "paragraph:52"
      ],
      "text": "R023 上传大小边界 [建议]\n要求：建议对多文件上传总大小和单文件大小均给出明确限制与错误返回。",
      "text_sha256": "22f04a4401fe67cf8431cf6e2afe604163ffa7109d7bc640feee357e3dfe8a5f"
    },
    "R024": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:53",
        "paragraph:54"
      ],
      "text": "R024 浏览器覆盖 [建议]\n要求：建议覆盖Windows Chrome、Windows Edge与macOS Safari16，不能以系统能开网页作为兼容依据。",
      "text_sha256": "73ec1d593aabd694b97789ed179fc2f6f78e27568eb9cfda3d59a4725cfcc042"
    },
    "R025": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:55",
        "paragraph:56"
      ],
      "text": "R025 API版本及错误码 [建议]\n要求：建议明确API版本和稳定错误码，并能追踪版本变化。",
      "text_sha256": "015aee64148dbc5da944ed664ace68d050d9258c81b7b7fcecfc08b2fed37f92"
    },
    "R026": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:57",
        "paragraph:58"
      ],
      "text": "R026 偏移续传与校验 [必须]\n要求：断线后应按已确认字节偏移继续上传，并在完成后校验文件；仅重新连接后整文件重传不算续传。",
      "text_sha256": "f26092d835281b5413b77f1482e9efd8289d1d140176c988105b41a749b319a1"
    },
    "R027": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:59",
        "paragraph:60"
      ],
      "text": "R027 质量管理证明 [建议]\n要求：质量管理证明作为建议项，持证主体应为本次投标人，且在投标截止日有效。",
      "text_sha256": "2e320cec6cd2176e76cac95fcfad26486abc973ce8148dd9c594ce692a9a0e1f"
    },
    "R028": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:61",
        "paragraph:62"
      ],
      "text": "R028 当前软件使用授权 [建议]\n要求：建议提供LCSoft2.4版本使用授权，主体、版本与有效期均应适用。",
      "text_sha256": "aa8c46cdcda8804a6510e7c0e103b2ffbbe400a7f16bfd8402999991efcde5e7"
    },
    "R029": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:64",
        "paragraph:65"
      ],
      "text": "R029 设备安全证明 [必须]\n要求：必须有适用于LC-G2的设备安全证明，投标截止日仍有效，不能按编稿日期判断。",
      "text_sha256": "6809a620f77724edb27cdbcf6427614f30c3d5408d6290689d796576735406f7"
    },
    "R030": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:66",
        "paragraph:67"
      ],
      "text": "R030 主体信息安全证明 [必须]\n要求：必须有投标人同主体的信息安全管理证明，并在投标截止日有效。",
      "text_sha256": "bfcb7ce29b988e41476fb2e059f366950626d35a87afd27b9434b221e6d2e37a"
    },
    "R031": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:68",
        "paragraph:69"
      ],
      "text": "R031 本型号环保证明 [必须]\n要求：必须提供LC-G2型号环保检测证明，系列简称或上一代型号不能自动覆盖本型号。",
      "text_sha256": "4a8edb322fe7e06c7c076c4173707a721ce49dd0d311c513cf4bb2592e3b227a"
    },
    "R032": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:70",
        "paragraph:71"
      ],
      "text": "R032 密码模块符合性 [建议]\n要求：建议提供LC-CM1模块在LC-G2平台适用的符合性报告，截止日当日仍在有效期也可采用。",
      "text_sha256": "b3cc71591ba979335a5934a270c83b5e1300546660132b53b82c8368f36645ba"
    },
    "R033": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:72",
        "paragraph:73"
      ],
      "text": "R033 可编辑交付与来源 [必须]\n要求：交付应同时含原生可编辑文档、源资料及差异说明，只有最终PDF不足。",
      "text_sha256": "e029dda70caee3796f89aab90922d6cda522632a987a3b90a5b6d8b0f670d570"
    },
    "R034": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:74",
        "paragraph:75"
      ],
      "text": "R034 支持响应口径 [建议]\n要求：建议工作时段4小时内确认问题及下一步；响应不等于所有问题4小时修复。",
      "text_sha256": "020b1a1c493b29088907e064dc0859963cade8355b1ee1421f12e41de17624ba"
    },
    "R035": {
      "source": "requirements.docx",
      "source_sha256": "00292a275239c3b1186f9010b2f9d15dce069c0eca868f3e0963cf2aff116ac7",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:76",
        "paragraph:77"
      ],
      "text": "R035 跨版本限制说明 [建议]\n要求：建议保留版本对应关系、已知限制及未确认项，不以文件更新时间代替版本依据。",
      "text_sha256": "424442a44f4def92d92ef27b8f35f1f62c6f31444da3ddc7f6eaf246101fe80c"
    },
    "D001": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:4",
        "paragraph:5"
      ],
      "text": "D001 对应R001 物理计算核心\n现有材料支持该项：LC-G2为2颗16核处理器，共32物理核心、64逻辑线程；物理核与线程分开登记。",
      "text_sha256": "ea8f1e252a2790220766204e7d9cad89373db5d8c257bead82da820ff1b98ed1"
    },
    "D002": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
