      ],
      "text": "F006 工作温度范围\n工作温度为0至40摄氏度，存放温度为负20至60摄氏度；两项没有混用。",
      "text_sha256": "814655bff71bf7325c0746bc7346279dd9441cdd9ccc9866a5777437b182f512"
    },
    "F007": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:82",
        "paragraph:83"
      ],
      "text": "F007 文件名与字节保真\nLCSoft2.4支持UTF-8中文路径，文件按字节透传，输入输出SHA一致；不是仅有主机名显示中文。",
      "text_sha256": "1f5ace2cf394d83578904f24ee19ef6f88d0d85713643d2871d1678ca40aa3f4"
    },
    "F008": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:85",
        "paragraph:86"
      ],
      "text": "F008 已确认数据持久化\n已确认写入经过日志落盘；节点重启的离线记录确认数据可恢复，不只是重新启动进程。",
      "text_sha256": "563bfcbc65b6026c259c4e00c836160e495f81fc7c10b1035c72808109c194d8"
    },
    "F009": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:87",
        "paragraph:88"
      ],
      "text": "F009 离线安装材料\n已准备离线包、版本清单和SHA清单；安装过程不要求连接外部下载站点。",
      "text_sha256": "62a2558072c6600a343c6ed48240c91b30bbf1e64db03527aec73df01b8efe4c"
    },
    "F010": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:89",
        "paragraph:90"
      ],
      "text": "F010 两种架构兼容\nLCSoft2.4有Debian12 x86-64和arm64两个独立构建，兼容记录已覆盖两种架构。",
      "text_sha256": "ac4365f1fd429a353532e96bdfda20ddb9686675892597cea25c7784d88b1c48"
    },
    "F011": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:91",
        "paragraph:92"
      ],
      "text": "F011 项目隔离\n项目命名空间和访问校验已隔离，跨项目读取被拒绝；依据是应用访问记录，不是两台机器的数量。",
      "text_sha256": "d7e86d395b841760ec524d699a9337192820704a5594936a650df6e3964f4264"
    },
    "F012": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:93",
        "paragraph:94"
      ],
      "text": "F012 两类本地检索\n支持记录ID精确查找与字段内容包含检索，两类接口和结果样例均已核验。",
      "text_sha256": "457fe305ade749330066546c25f66f5401bdeb7b3dee1cedd2380218a35f679a"
    },
    "F013": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:95",
        "paragraph:96"
      ],
      "text": "F013 账户停用后授权\n账户停用会拒绝新会话并吊销现有令牌，已用请求记录核对。",
      "text_sha256": "d5a2e387091a77e2f4e37dfa6c71600cf5ce2d645949700340795721479eabbc"
    },
    "F014": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:97",
        "paragraph:98"
      ],
      "text": "F014 角色及记录范围\n现版本支持角色授权，但没有记录级范围配置；项目隔离不等于同一项目内记录级权限。",
      "text_sha256": "73c33ff84be1bc51855a47f319f493ef41302ae4f57be7d54bd5601c22bfd60b"
    },
    "F015": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:100",
        "paragraph:101"
      ],
      "text": "F015 导出权限一致\n导出沿用现有访问校验，未授权项目不能导出；本卡不声称拥有F014没有的记录级权限。",
      "text_sha256": "2e5381a9c5e597ecff1b62dfcfd56e9f137a54e012441ae3227331070e00177e"
    },
    "F016": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:102",
        "paragraph:103"
      ],
      "text": "F016 版本追踪与恢复\n历史版本ID可查询并能恢复指定版本，恢复记录保留源版本与结果版本。",
      "text_sha256": "eb0d6e5a7c5a700b07a3b53142a8a5af1af53e89f733951f638e7f27735c2fda"
    },
    "F017": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:104",
        "paragraph:105"
      ],
      "text": "F017 失败子项重试\n提供逐项失败清单；现版本只能整批重试，不能仅重试失败子项。",
      "text_sha256": "c4f378ae4d97052c81df7e591aabcee5a97a35c3335ea85dd2c654e27b40b097"
    },
    "F018": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:106",
        "paragraph:107"
      ],
      "text": "F018 传输通道保护\n当前通道启用TLS1.2及TLS1.3，配置记录可核对；该记录仅证明传输保护。",
      "text_sha256": "f4599c3c4595a452199eb567fff42fcd44504939fbf7714a176cec389c9e3b80"
    },
    "F019": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:108",
        "paragraph:109"
      ],
      "text": "F019 静态备份加密\nLCSoft2.4当前备份以明文保存，没有内置静态备份加密；可另行研究外部磁盘加密，但尚未部署。",
      "text_sha256": "708241e94ae11bf1b04845152b3c94a404f05ae4e037e54cd9559bca705165e4"
    },
    "F020": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:110",
        "paragraph:111"
      ],
      "text": "F020 审计字段与留存\n记录含操作者ID、带时区时间和对象ID，留存策略为180天；配置及样例已核对。",
      "text_sha256": "6ebc5c34931ffa89bc195394f8fe4e8c423bf685feccb528e475d2bfef5ce0df"
    },
    "F021": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:112",
        "paragraph:113"
      ],
      "text": "F021 CSV基础格式\nCSV导出为UTF-8，字段引号与换行正确转义；本卡仅证明基础格式，不证明F022的未知能力。",
      "text_sha256": "33ce07661b3a26d8030d36a1cf24de5f1df9e10d0d9f5d740324f9d2a2b9367d"
    },
    "F022": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:115",
        "paragraph:116"
      ],
      "text": "F022 稳定ID及续页导出\n本次材料未提供稳定记录ID及续页导出的核验记录，能力是否具备尚未确认；不能据F021或硬件配置推定。",
      "text_sha256": "13c57a01f9849fac8e2af2114b22e73fffff1efce8c82095c20ebce54dd6c5f0"
    },
    "F023": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:117",
        "paragraph:118"
      ],
      "text": "F023 上传大小边界\n单文件和总大小均校验，超限返回明确错误码；样例包括恰好到上限和超过上限。",
      "text_sha256": "73ef22f45e5a4735facc4446b342ce11a29dc5d2bde869275d1d0ed50d319cb1"
    },
    "F024": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:119",
        "paragraph:120"
      ],
      "text": "F024 浏览器覆盖\n已支持Windows Chrome与Edge；Safari16当前不支持，不能把未实现项写为已验证。",
      "text_sha256": "ddb59c71f96e6f84ac64f3541343f236a0fa754831cb591d3379524b4a906f40"
    },
    "F025": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:121",
        "paragraph:122"
      ],
      "text": "F025 API版本及错误码\nAPI v2.4版本号、稳定错误码及变更记录均可提供；错误码不只写在聊天解释中。",
      "text_sha256": "de0a87dcebb55ad4e8732e6930a094d8f6ad31e8d95ae8e57f52699fc12e188c"
    },
    "F026": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:123",
        "paragraph:124"
      ],
      "text": "F026 偏移续传与校验\n当前能重连并对整文件传完后的SHA校验，但不保存已确认偏移，只能整文件重传。",
      "text_sha256": "c8f093cdb696c6fdb07e18836d289fe5b9110fd3286a98099d8b0c89dccf03b7"
    },
    "F027": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:125",
        "paragraph:126"
      ],
      "text": "F027 质量管理证明\nF027登记投标人为临川数联技术有限公司，质量管理证明使用C01，不借用其它主体证书。",
      "text_sha256": "88022355bfd592b6a73fac682c3cefcd985597847aa54c24cf14f912ff9ee2d3"
    },
    "F028": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:127",
        "paragraph:128"
      ],
      "text": "F028 当前软件使用授权\n当前交付软件为LCSoft2.4，使用授权使用C05；不是其它版本通用说明。",
      "text_sha256": "cf2e558f5f562e605d8a851d0e8b8c9c47272a2f0bc1ccff2f595853db6645fb"
    },
    "F029": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:130",
        "paragraph:131"
      ],
      "text": "F029 设备安全证明\n设备型号为LC-G2，材料中设备安全证明仅提供C02，未随附续证材料。",
      "text_sha256": "8cd6fa5c9f3c87339b06895f3839ac2132c1e47e98873fd96e9b2d9ca26e268a"
    },
    "F030": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:132",
        "paragraph:133"
      ],
      "text": "F030 主体信息安全证明\n信息安全管理证明仅有C03，主体为临川数联技术有限公司；未提供更新证明。",
      "text_sha256": "791206da5f13e8a05004f63d8013f0858795aae5e60169c91d4f6ab7f3916862"
    },
    "F031": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:134",
        "paragraph:135"
      ],
      "text": "F031 本型号环保证明\n本项目选型LC-G2；C06只列LC-G1，未列LC-G2，未提供本型号环保证明。",
      "text_sha256": "6fcca004776ed51e7b2844aba440765bc84a4545af6a2ee7d1d016188754d7a0"
    },
    "F032": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:136",
        "paragraph:137"
      ],
      "text": "F032 密码模块符合性\n当前配置为LC-CM1模块配LC-G2平台，符合性报告为C04；适用范围需与两者对应。",
      "text_sha256": "7810c10354001ea581744657b87cacbedce02b4711457950138c23ecba6a5835"
    },
    "F033": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:138",
        "paragraph:139"
      ],
      "text": "F033 可编辑交付与来源\n交付清单包含DOCX、XLSX原生文档、源资料目录和差异清单；不只提供PDF。",
      "text_sha256": "5d4104e97768a9ad99b8361083d185c21b56e70c78bd07ab226677192c293dd9"
    },
    "F034": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:140",
        "paragraph:141"
      ],
      "text": "F034 支持响应口径\n支持台可在工作时段4小时内确认问题并说明下一步；没有承诺全部问题4小时完成修复。",
      "text_sha256": "914f3be556a17e9bbf7b038729d9d892c738bb4f8ee3e67da8c98d4e8e90af53"
    },
    "F035": {
      "source": "response.docx",
      "source_sha256": "caf464129817e016a610518fffb40ee7223ee5c02e58963e26aa9f11929deb2a",
      "locators": [
        "paragraph:142",
        "paragraph:143"
      ],
      "text": "F035 跨版本限制说明\n版本表会记录输入版本、输出版本、已知限制与未确认项，更新日期只作为时间信息。",
      "text_sha256": "e357ca197e05fec0398d191a7c7c3314b4268df9a666506a06c271a01d11794e"
    },
